{"resourceIdentifier":"3061","resourceName":"Hexian MSW Landfill Site LFG recovery to power project","description":"Hexian MSW Landfill Site LFG recovery to power project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Hexian MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as Hexian landfill site), in Hexian County, Maanshan City, Anhui Province,P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Hexian BCCY Urban new energy Co., Ltd.\r\nHexian landfill site started collecting and handling waste at the 25/03/2022.\r\nThe project started to construct on 12/10/2021. The project has a total designed capacity 1MW (2*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 40,989MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project are 35,559tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 355,587tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.\r\nScenario existing prior to the implementation of the project (the same as baseline scenario):\r\nLFG from Hexian landfill site is emitted to the atmosphere directly.\r\nEquivalent electricity generated by the project is supplied by the CCPG, which is dominated by fossil fuel based power plants.","location":{"latitude":31.460000,"longitude":118.120000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-25","endExclusive":"2022-06-25","endInclusive":"2022-06-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3061"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"st